<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HINGIS V NAGYOVA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HINGIS V NAGYOVA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
